{
	"nodes": [
		{
			"id": "title-node",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 0,
			"y": -400,
			"width": 600,
			"height": 80,
			"color": "6",
			"text": "# Solution Explorer View\n\n**View Type:** `flowti-solution-explorer` | **Icon:** `folder-tree` | **Location:** Left Sidebar"
		},
		{
			"id": "layout-group",
			"type": "group",
			"x": -200,
			"y": -280,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 600,
			"color": "0",
			"label": "Left Sidebar Layout"
		},
		{
			"id": "header-section",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -180,
			"y": -240,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 80,
			"color": "5",
			"text": "## Header\n`ft-explorer-header`\n\n**Solutions** | [Refresh ↻]"
		},
		{
			"id": "solution-list",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -180,
			"y": -140,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 240,
			"color": "4",
			"text": "## Solution List\n`ft-explorer-list`\n\n| Icon | Name | Phase |\n|------|------|-------|\n| 💻 | **Flowti** *(active)* | Design |\n| 📦 | MyApp | Ideate |\n| 🛒 | WebShop | Validate |\n| 📱 | Mobile App | Develop |\n\n*Click to select → emits `solution.selected`*"
		},
		{
			"id": "add-button",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -180,
			"y": 120,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "3",
			"text": "## Footer\n`ft-explorer-footer`\n\n**[+ New Solution]** → opens CreateSolutionModal"
		},
		{
			"id": "empty-state",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -180,
			"y": 200,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 100,
			"color": "0",
			"text": "### Empty State\n\n*No solutions yet*\n\nClick \"+\" to create your first solution"
		},
		{
			"id": "events-node",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 280,
			"y": -240,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 180,
			"color": "1",
			"text": "## Event Subscriptions\n\n**Listens to:**\n- `solution.created` → refreshList()\n- `solution.updated` → refreshList()\n- `solution.deleted` → refreshList()\n- `solution.selected` → update active state\n\n**Emits:**\n- `solution.selected` → { solutionId: string }"
		},
		{
			"id": "behavior-node",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 280,
			"y": -40,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 200,
			"color": "2",
			"text": "## Behavior\n\n**On Click (Solution Item):**\n1. Set `selectedSolutionId`\n2. Emit `solution.selected` event\n3. Re-render with active state\n4. Open SolutionDetailView if not open\n\n**On Click (+ New Solution):**\n1. Open CreateSolutionModal\n2. On success → solution.created emitted\n3. List refreshes automatically"
		},
		{
			"id": "css-classes",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 280,
			"y": 180,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 140,
			"color": "4",
			"text": "## CSS Classes\n\n- `.flowti-solution-explorer` - Main container\n- `.ft-explorer-header` - Top header with title\n- `.ft-explorer-list` - Scrollable list area\n- `.ft-explorer-footer` - Bottom with add button\n- `.ft-sidebar-item-icon` - Solution type icon"
		}
	],
	"edges": [
		{
			"id": "edge-header-list",
			"fromNode": "header-section",
			"toNode": "solution-list",
			"fromSide": "bottom",
			"toSide": "top"
		},
		{
			"id": "edge-list-footer",
			"fromNode": "solution-list",
			"toNode": "add-button",
			"fromSide": "bottom",
			"toSide": "top"
		},
		{
			"id": "edge-list-events",
			"fromNode": "solution-list",
			"toNode": "events-node",
			"fromSide": "right",
			"toSide": "left",
			"label": "onClick"
		}
	]
}
